B.amg=new A.f(B.kL,["2.7.0 update","Page {0} of {1}","Next","Back","Start playing","Limit breakthroughs","Room to grow from any start","In new careers, stat limits can rise. Play in the first team and earn ratings and awards to fill the breakthrough gauge. When it fills, choose which stat\u2019s limit to raise.","Starting limits are shown as Ordinary, Starter, League elite or World-class. Stats that start lower gain more room with each breakthrough.","Careers already in progress keep their current rules through to the end.","Your good start and facilities stay","Play builds on a good start","High stats and limits from rerolling still give you a head start. Breakthroughs add growth on top of that.","Gold facility levels 1\u201310 keep their effects. New extension levels 11\u201315 help with training growth, limit gains at breakthroughs, injury recovery and aging throughout your career.","Raise all four facilities to level 15 to earn the \u201cFully Extended\u201d title.","Your own play style","7 per position, each with a signature","Your chosen style\u2019s signature changes match results. Each shines in different moments, such as headers, free kicks or shootouts. You can also see which manager tactics suit it.","After your third breakthrough, your style evolves. Choose to push your strengths further or cover your weaknesses.","Late-bloomer starts are now free for everyone. Second-division starts are coming soon.","Breakthrough gauge","Full","Limit","Breakthrough +4","Your start from rerolling","Gold facilities Lv.1\u201310","Extensions Lv.11\u201315","Unchanged","Newly open","Push strengths","Cover weaknesses","Limits rise through play. A high start from rerolling still puts you ahead.","Close note","Extensions are open","Level 1\u201310 effects stay the same. New levels 11\u201315 keep helping as your career unfolds.","{0} helps training growth, {1} helps limit gains at breakthroughs, {2} helps injury recovery, and {3} helps reduce age-related decline."],t.w)
